<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<openrocket version="1.11" creator="OpenRocket 26.xx-SNAPSHOT-5f164fd0e">
  <rocket>
    <name>Pods--airframes and winglets</name>
    <id>d29714d3-4fa9-452a-84f4-e5dd0e06fcc5</id>
    <axialoffset method="absolute">0.0</axialoffset>
    <position type="absolute">0.0</position>
    <comment>This design demonstrates two uses of pods, both for the traditional &quot;wing pods&quot;, and also using a phantom body tube to implement &quot;fins on fins&quot; for the horizontal stabilizer.

Pods can also have motor mounts, but that is not shown here.</comment>
